## Title: Better Group Finder (Console)
## Description: A better group finder for console and gamepad: browse and search groups with filters, pick what you're doing from descriptive activity presets, and post listings with automatically generated roles, title and description. Main Menu > Better Group Finder, R3 on the Activity Finder, or /bgf.
